        "wolf": "hit",
        "guards": "hit",
        "ephanna": "evidence_gap"
      },
      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The fight in the Council Chamber involves the Players, the Wolf, Thalia, and multiple Guards (including reinforcements); no council members are explicitly confirmed present in the provided context.\n\nBased on OBSERVED and CANON facts:\n- **Players (group)** are present and actively engaged in the battle (\u201cParty is actively in battle\u201d).\n- **The Wolf** is explicitly in the **Council Room** and is the central adversary of the encounter.\n- **Thalia** is present (\u201cWolf is standing at Thalia\u2019s shoulder\u201d) and participates in combat after acting under the Wolf\u2019s influence.\n- **Guards** are present in force:\n  - Some are already inside (ringing walls, engaging players).\n  - Additional guards are \u201cbeing drawn here as reinforcements\u201d to the Council Chamber.\n\nThere is **no explicit mention** of council members being physically present during the fight in this projection, despite earlier governance interactions.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Participants: Players, The Wolf, Thalia, Guards (including elite and reinforcements)\n- Location: Council Chamber (large circular room, magical defenses active)\n- \u05de\u05e6\u05d1: Active combat with illusions, traps, and reinforcements entering",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
