      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The Shepherds are a cult group (the Shepherd\u2019s Flock) actively recruiting and agitating in the city, and they answer to the power of **Maelthor**.\n\nThe **Shepherd\u2019s Flock** are cultists operating openly as protesters while secretly advancing a darker agenda. They recruit vulnerable or \u201ctransformed\u201d individuals, framing their actions as necessary to \u201ccleanse\u201d the world and promote **human supremacy** (CANON). They also present incidents as defensive acts against non-human threats to maintain public sympathy (OBSERVED).\n\nTheir allegiance is explicitly tied to **Maelthor**:\n- OBSERVED: They are \u201cfollowers of Maelthor.\u201d\n- OBSERVED: They are aligned with \u201cMaelthor\u2019s influence and emergence.\u201d\n\nThis indicates they are not just ideological extremists, but agents of a rising or active power tied to Maelthor.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Role: Cultists staging protests and recruiting members\n- Goals: Cleanse \u201cimpurities,\u201d enforce human supremacy, expand their ranks\n- Loyalty: Devoted to Maelthor and its growing influence\n- Activity: Public protest + covert recruitment of transformed individuals\n- Presence: Visible at city gates, distributing messaging and gathering support",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q_the_city_council_2",
      "question": "Who speaks for the wizards on the council, and what's his angle on the cult?",
      "strict_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "semantic_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "must_hits": [
        "headmaster tinkerbright",
        "wizard's college",
