      "answer": "TL;DR: Torrin represents the Guilds (crafts/industry), Rurik oversees infrastructure (city structure and defenses), and Merril\u2019s council role is not defined in the provided context.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Torrin Flamescale (CANON + OBSERVED)\n  - Role: Representative of the Guilds; Master Smith\n  - Domain: Craft guilds, industry, practical city concerns\n  - Notes: Speaks bluntly on city issues; respected craftsman\n\n- Rurik Stonehammer (CANON + OBSERVED)\n  - Role: Representative of Infrastructure; Chief Architect\n  - Domain: City structure, defenses, tunnels/sewers, structural integrity\n  - Notes: Focused on sealing vulnerabilities and maintaining defenses\n\n- Merril\n  - Role: Not specified in the projection\n  - Note: The context contains no facts identifying Merril\u2019s council job, so it cannot be determined from current data.",
